    {
      "text": "You will need 8 mugs or glass coffee cups. Pour 1 ounce of coffee liqueur into each mug, then add one ounce of brandy and 1/2 ounce of creme de cacao to each serving. Fill each mug with hot coffee, garnish with a dollop of whipped cream, and top with chocolate sprinkles; serve.",
